      description: |-
        Manage a single package of a marketplace listing.

        GET: Retrieve package details (public).
        PUT / PATCH: Update package dimensions (seller only).
        DELETE: Remove a package from the listing (seller only). Cannot delete the last package — a listing must always have at least one.
